      "id": "rung_main_820dbbc5-81da-4169-8a64-b423d51de1e8",
      "comment": "Transition 10 -> 20: jobs done, something to move, and C2 has room. NOT(S5 AND Outfeed_Full) = /S5 OR /Outfeed_Full (De Morgan), so this rung and Transition 10 -> 15 never both fire; NOT Stop_Request: a requested stop goes to IDLE instead (Transition -> 0), so at most one transition fires per scan (mutually exclusive)",
