    {
      "id": "rung_main_d2b184d4-4995-403f-bcfd-f73ab270796a",
      "comment": "Transition -> 0 at a safe point (Stop_Request): WORK with all jobs done, WAIT_OUTFEED, or end of INDEX (S8 edge). INDEX without S8 is not a safe point: the belt finishes its move first. Bottles may stay inside; Start continues with WORK.",
      "defaultBounds": [
        300,
